@startuml
title What a saga scenario test controls and what it observes

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 8
}

rectangle "**Scenario test**" as T #FFF8E1

rectangle "**Services under test**\nOrder · Inventory · Payment · Cart · Catalog · Notification\nThe simulated providers are adapters inside\nthe payment and notification services" as S #F4F7F9

rectangle "**Bus emulator**" as BUS #FFFFFF

rectangle "**Gate**, one per consumer\nEvery message passes through it before reaching its consumer.\nIt forwards unchanged; told to, it holds, releases\nor repeats a type of message." as G #FFE0B2

rectangle "**What the test observes**\nEvery message, by a subscription on each topic\nThe records of the simulated providers\nThe interfaces of the order and inventory services\nThe measures of each service" as O #C8E6C9

T -down-> S : places orders, decides as an administrator;\nfreezes, kills and starts a service;\nchooses the token, ends a blackout
S -down-> BUS : publishes
BUS -down-> G : delivers through
T -right-> O : reads
T -down-> G : holds and releases
@enduml
